Vestira Koi is a dwarven woman of [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]], the crew of a ship from beyond the [[Phenomena/Firmament|firmament]]. She has a long beard and black hair, and wears the service's sixteen-pointed star. She serves as the crew's liaison officer, trained to suppress the anomalies that space and time throw up.

She walked the Party through the ritual of suppression over the ship's speaker grates, one glyph at a time, and warned them that the rite works by giving the thing being suppressed life, so that it can be fought and killed. She asks who she is dealing with before she says much. She knows the [[Divinity/Ashen Pact/index|Ashen Pact]] gods by their Thessian names. After the rescue she took charge of the survivors, asked the Party to help find the rest of her crew, and offered directions to [[Divinity/Ashen Pact/Esoterica|Gremory]].
